  m_text: 'First comes the Poet,

    whose quill writes the story.


    Second
    comes the Librarian,

    whose book contains all knowledge.


    Third comes
    the Blacksmith,

    whose lamp lights his work.


    Next comes the Butcher,

    whose
    knife cuts the meat.


    Last comes the Merchant,

    whose purse pays them
    all.'
